Package: com.amorcool.altdaemonios17rootlessfix
Name: AltDaemon iOS 17 Rootless Fix
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Fixes AltDaemon 1.0.1 SIGSEGV in XPCConnectionHandler on iOS 17 rootless (Dopamine).
 Applies two validated ARM64 NOP patches, preserves a backup, re-signs AltDaemon,
 and resets its launchd registration. Ported from the iOS 17 RootHide fix.
 Depends on com.rileytestut.altdaemon (>= 1.0.1). The patch targets the exact
 AltDaemon 1.0.1 binary; on other builds it installs but performs no patch.
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Author: AmorCool
Maintainer: AmorCool
Depends: com.rileytestut.altdaemon (>= 1.0.1), ldid
Tag: role::enduser
